# Production build: serve .stt tile archives from Cloudflare R2 instead of
# bundling ~16GB into the deploy. datasets.ts rewrites every /data/*.stt path
# to <VITE_DATA_BASE_URL>/data/*.stt. Public, non-secret — safe to commit.
#
# Served from the R2 bucket's Cloudflare custom domain (edge-cached). The old
# dev URL was https://pub-9bfdd9f4981d44b1acb3624ba7bded45.r2.dev — uncached and
# rate-limited, not for production. Vite reads this at build time (production
# mode), so Cloudflare Pages' Git-driven build picks it up from this committed file.
VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=https://tiles.poopdeck.gl
